l apply the resulting script to `file1'.          (cat script; echo '1,$p') | ed - file1RESTRICTIONS     Text lines that consist of a single `.' will defeat -e.FILES     /tmp/d3?????     /usr/lib/diff3SEE ALSO     diff(1)